      "writtenOn": "2020-03-09T14:01:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "IIUC you are assuming:\n  1. When creating network, transport types are always set before update dns config.\n  2. When transport type changes, you don\u0027t really need this info sent to resolver.\n  3. The hashMap is always accessed on the same thread.\n\nFor 1,2 maybe update the javadoc if it is what you are expecting.\nFor 3, if true, maybe update the javadoc, if false, add multi-thread protection for it.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 312,
        "startChar": 5,
        "endLine": 312,
        "endChar": 49
      },
      "revId": "3285b9ce848d23c2d80b69e50d57088dd9db3a7a",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "87f9eb15_2944f5f8",
