      "writtenOn": "2020-03-11T11:37:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It is super confusing in CS that sometimes you need to call  \nsetDnsConfigurationForNetwork but sometimes don\u0027t,\ngiven updateTransportTypesForNetwork is already called.\nI think you\u0027ll need to judge that when calling into updateTransportTypeForNetwork",
      "parentUuid": "12d7ab5a_40ca36cf",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 321,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 321,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "3285b9ce848d23c2d80b69e50d57088dd9db3a7a",
