        "id": 1306837
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-03-12T04:43:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes I understand that sometimes you want to invoke binder call and sometimes you don\u0027t.\nHowever it should be a implementation detail that handled inside DnsManager.\nFrom the semantics, ConnectivityService should update the transport types whenever it has changed. How DnsManager use such information should be retained inside DnsManager.",
      "parentUuid": "fc8a7f56_685b545c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 321,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 321,
        "endChar": 5
      },
